{"vid":"7pYc4rvGKNI","source":"7pYc4rvGKNI.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.5,"txt":"Welding visual testing what you need to"},{"t":2.9,"txt":"know. Welding is a critical process in"},{"t":5.5,"txt":"construction and manufacturing"},{"t":7,"txt":"industries. Welds that are not properly"},{"t":9.6,"txt":"executed can result in safety hazards,"},{"t":12.1,"txt":"structural failures, and costly repairs."},{"t":15,"txt":"Visual inspection is a non-destructive"},{"t":17.2,"txt":"testing NDT weld quality check process."},{"t":21,"txt":"During the testing method, the weld is"},{"t":23.3,"txt":"examined visually through the eyes to"},{"t":25,"txt":"determine surface discontinuities."},{"t":27.4,"txt":"The process must be conducted by an"},{"t":29.4,"txt":"experienced welding inspector. Visual"},{"t":31.9,"txt":"testing is an essential quality control"},{"t":34,"txt":"measure that ensures that welded joints"},{"t":36,"txt":"meet the required standards. Welding"},{"t":38.5,"txt":"inspector play crucial role in examining"},{"t":40.6,"txt":"a welded joint. In this video, we'll"},{"t":43.4,"txt":"take a closer look at visual testing and"},{"t":45.4,"txt":"why it's crucial in welding."},{"t":52.3,"txt":"Visual testing is a non-destructive"},{"t":54.4,"txt":"testing method used to evaluate the"},{"t":56.3,"txt":"surface of welded joints. It involves a"},{"t":59,"txt":"trained inspector examining the weld"},{"t":60.9,"txt":"with their naked eye or using magnifying"},{"t":63,"txt":"equipment to identify any visual"},{"t":64.9,"txt":"imperfections. Visual testing can"},{"t":67.5,"txt":"identify a wide range of welding defects"},{"t":69.9,"txt":"such as porocity, cracks, undercutting,"},{"t":73.1,"txt":"incomplete fusion, and overlaps."},{"t":75.7,"txt":"Porocity is one of the most common"},{"t":77.6,"txt":"welding defects which occurs when gas is"},{"t":80.2,"txt":"trapped in the weld metal during the"},{"t":81.7,"txt":"welding process. Visual testing can"},{"t":84.2,"txt":"easily detect porocity as it appears as"},{"t":86.8,"txt":"small round holes on the surface of the"},{"t":88.9,"txt":"weld. Incomplete fusion is another"},{"t":91.4,"txt":"common welding defect which occurs when"},{"t":93.4,"txt":"the weld metal does not fully fuse with"},{"t":95.4,"txt":"the base metal or the previously"},{"t":97,"txt":"deposited weld metal. Visual testing can"},{"t":99.7,"txt":"detect incomplete fusion by examining"},{"t":101.8,"txt":"the appearance of the weld bead and the"},{"t":103.5,"txt":"presence of any visible gaps. Welding"},{"t":106.2,"txt":"joint with a crack is main cause of weld"},{"t":108.3,"txt":"failures. It's important not to leave"},{"t":110.9,"txt":"any crack as it make necessary welding"},{"t":113.8,"txt":"repair always. Welding joints with"},{"t":116.6,"txt":"cracks can be extremely dangerous as"},{"t":118.8,"txt":"they can compromise the structural"},{"t":120.3,"txt":"integrity of the welded structure."},{"t":122.6,"txt":"Visual testing can detect cracks by"},{"t":124.6,"txt":"examining the surface of the weld and"},{"t":126.5,"txt":"looking for visible breaks or"},{"t":127.8,"txt":"discontinuities."},{"t":129.3,"txt":"Once the visual testing is complete, the"},{"t":131.5,"txt":"welding inspector will mark the welded"},{"t":133.4,"txt":"joint with a paint marker or a stamp"},{"t":135.5,"txt":"indicating that it has passed the"},{"t":137,"txt":"inspection. Welding inspector should"},{"t":139.3,"txt":"sign off on an inspection report to"},{"t":141.3,"txt":"document the inspection results. A"},{"t":143.8,"txt":"comprehensive inspection report will"},{"t":145.5,"txt":"also be produced highlighting any visual"},{"t":147.9,"txt":"imperfections found during the testing"},{"t":149.8,"txt":"process. In conclusion, visual testing"},{"t":152.8,"txt":"is a critical part of the welding"},{"t":154.2,"txt":"process that ensures the safety and"},{"t":156.1,"txt":"quality of welded structures. By"},{"t":158.6,"txt":"identifying and addressing any welding"},{"t":160.4,"txt":"defects early on, visual testing can"},{"t":162.9,"txt":"prevent costly repairs and improve the"},{"t":164.9,"txt":"longevity of the welded structure."}],"words":[{"t":0.48,"w":"Welding"},{"t":1.04,"w":"visual"},{"t":1.439,"w":"testing"},{"t":2.159,"w":"what"},{"t":2.399,"w":"you"},{"t":2.56,"w":"need"},{"t":2.639,"w":"to"},{"t":2.879,"w":"know."},{"t":3.679,"w":"Welding"},{"t":4.16,"w":"is"},{"t":4.319,"w":"a"},{"t":4.48,"w":"critical"},{"t":4.88,"w":"process"},{"t":5.279,"w":"in"},{"t":5.52,"w":"construction"},{"t":6,"w":"and"},{"t":6.24,"w":"manufacturing"},{"t":6.96,"w":"industries."},{"t":8.16,"w":"Welds"},{"t":8.559,"w":"that"},{"t":8.8,"w":"are"},{"t":8.96,"w":"not"},{"t":9.12,"w":"properly"},{"t":9.599,"w":"executed"},{"t":10.16,"w":"can"},{"t":10.4,"w":"result"},{"t":10.639,"w":"in"},{"t":10.88,"w":"safety"},{"t":11.28,"w":"hazards,"},{"t":12.08,"w":"structural"},{"t":12.559,"w":"failures,"},{"t":13.12,"w":"and"},{"t":13.36,"w":"costly"},{"t":13.84,"w":"repairs."},{"t":15.04,"w":"Visual"},{"t":15.44,"w":"inspection"},{"t":16,"w":"is"},{"t":16.16,"w":"a"},{"t":16.4,"w":"non-destructive"},{"t":17.199,"w":"testing"},{"t":17.84,"w":"NDT"},{"t":18.8,"w":"weld"},{"t":19.119,"w":"quality"},{"t":19.6,"w":"check"},{"t":19.92,"w":"process."},{"t":21.039,"w":"During"},{"t":21.359,"w":"the"},{"t":21.52,"w":"testing"},{"t":21.92,"w":"method,"},{"t":22.56,"w":"the"},{"t":22.72,"w":"weld"},{"t":23.039,"w":"is"},{"t":23.279,"w":"examined"},{"t":23.68,"w":"visually"},{"t":24.16,"w":"through"},{"t":24.32,"w":"the"},{"t":24.56,"w":"eyes"},{"t":24.8,"w":"to"},{"t":25.039,"w":"determine"},{"t":25.439,"w":"surface"},{"t":25.84,"w":"discontinuities."},{"t":27.359,"w":"The"},{"t":27.68,"w":"process"},{"t":28.08,"w":"must"},{"t":28.4,"w":"be"},{"t":28.56,"w":"conducted"},{"t":28.96,"w":"by"},{"t":29.119,"w":"an"},{"t":29.359,"w":"experienced"},{"t":29.92,"w":"welding"},{"t":30.32,"w":"inspector."},{"t":31.439,"w":"Visual"},{"t":31.92,"w":"testing"},{